    "Create a new one: the official SteamOS image is downloaded from Valve and verified (about 4.5 GB; the disk uses ~10 GB on your Mac at first). Or choose an existing image, which is used in place and never copied." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
